Z||000000||Tweek||04-07-2001||09:37 AM||||This happened within the hour, I apoligize for all the pics for those of you on dialup. Basically I was hit directy in the side by a '94 sunbird that was going maybe 20 mph... boy am I pissed. But I think I can replace the door and a few other things, what do you think??<P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.oswg.net/Ted/badthings0022.jpg">  <BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.oswg.net/Ted/badthings0019.jpg">  <BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.oswg.net/Ted/badthings0020.jpg">  <BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.oswg.net/Ted/badthings0021.jpg">  <p>[This message has been edited by Tweek (edited 04-07-2001).]||||reg||1
